abstract: >-
  FLIMKit is an analysis package for time-domain fluorescence lifetime imaging
  microscopy (FLIM). It reads the common instrument formats (PicoQuant .ptu,
  Becker & Hickl .sdt, Photonscore .photons, ISS FastFLIM/Vista) through one
  loader, reconstructs per-pixel decay cubes, and fits them with n-exponential
  iterative reconvolution, alongside phasor analysis, tile stitching and batch
  processing.
